Three-way benchmark experiment `window10` (docs/THREE_WAY_BENCHMARK.md, "Experiments"): NOT a
library change. Applied to a scratch copy of the prototype publish only: the guest's lazy window
starts with 10 rows (preload 9 past the first visible row) instead of 16 (preload 15), about what
the A12 shows (9-10 rows of 72 dp under the 128 dp of header, actions and status line).

  git apply sample/threeway-guest/experiments/lazy-window-10.patch
  ./gradlew :keliver-compose-gatea-compose:publishToMavenLocal -Dmaven.repo.local=<copy of the m2> \
    -PkeliverVersion=0.0.0-gateb -PkeliverComposePrototype -DRELEASE_SIGNING_ENABLED=false
  git checkout -- keliver-compose-gatea-compose

